And shouldn't a player be able to _feel_ invisible
writing, as the PC can now "feel" inscriptions when
blind? Being invisible shouldn't make the writing
impalpable; monsters being invisible certainly
doesn't make _them_ impalpable.

That engraving with a wand of invisible makes the
now invisible writing also impalpable is, I think, a
bug.

