the invisible writing is still present.

So, finger engraving "x", engrave testing with a
wand of invisibility, seeing "the engraving
vanishes" or whatever, engraving "foo", should, when
blind-tested, read "xfoo"; the player will have
"added to the message" without knowing so until it
is blind-tested.

